[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12663.51, "timestamp": "03:31:03", "text": "使用 Voice Meter 以及"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12669.349, "timestamp": "03:31:09", "text": "Superon Waveform。不，不，不。什麼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12673.03, "timestamp": "03:31:13", "text": "不是波浪，也不是超級波浪。我到底在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12675.67, "timestamp": "03:31:15", "text": "說什麼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12680.229, "timestamp": "03:31:20", "text": "嗯，這裡風景不錯，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12684.309, "timestamp": "03:31:24", "text": "有時候雨下得太大了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12687.91, "timestamp": "03:31:27", "text": "這裡也是安全點。終於"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12690.469, "timestamp": "03:31:30", "text": "可以儲存並結束了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12698.79, "timestamp": "03:31:38", "text": "好的。呃，不傳送其他東西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12700.63, "timestamp": "03:31:40", "text": "至少它阻止了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12703.67, "timestamp": "03:31:43", "text": "壓力鍋和攪拌機的噪音。是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12705.269, "timestamp": "03:31:45", "text": "你知道，對我來說，以前在印度的時候，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12708.15, "timestamp": "03:31:48", "text": "家外面在施工，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12711.51, "timestamp": "03:31:51", "text": "Super Clear 公司做得很好，他們把那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12713.83, "timestamp": "03:31:53", "text": "東西都拆除了，這真是太好了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12716.79, "timestamp": "03:31:56", "text": "。我對這次出色的抑制效果非常滿意"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12718.95, "timestamp": "03:31:58", "text": "。"}]